 to such cash. Broadcom's free cash flow may not be calculated in a manner comparable to similarly named measures used by other companies. 


 About Broadcom 


 Broadcom Inc. (NASDAQ&#58; AVGO) is a technology leader that designs, develops, and supplies semiconductors and infrastructure software for global organizations' complex, mission-critical needs. Broadcom combines long-term R&#38;D investment with superb execution to deliver the best technology, at scale. Broadcom is a Delaware corporation headquartered in Palo Alto, CA. For more information, visit www.broadcom.com. 


